    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_base" kindref="compound">Base</ref> class for the iterative itegration of PDEs using the FE method. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="author"><para>Adrian Burri </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="date"><para>2004</para>
</simplesect>
Provide a base class for transient algorithms which involve an iterative solution algorithm on every time-step.</para>
<sect1 id="classcsmp_1_1_two_phase_implicit_node_centered_f_v_transport_1design">
<title>Design Intent</title><para>Make it easier to derive special iterative schemes. Basically, only the method Residual needs to be overwritten.</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="classcsmp_1_1_solver_1participants">
<title>Participants</title><para>The <ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_p_d_e___integrator" kindref="compound">PDE_Integrator</ref> base class.</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="classcsmp_1_1_two_phase_implicit_node_centered_f_v_transport_1collaboration">
<title>Collaboration</title><para>Models, Visitors and Interrelations. Calculations on single <ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_region" kindref="compound">Region</ref> objects is not supported. </para>
</sect1>
    </detaileddescription>
